may not be displayed on the <abb>ND</abb> on ground.</para></inform></noteproc></inform><action layer="1" lid="N.00008862.0001001.040" memory="false"><command code="00008862.0001001.020"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008862.0001001.041">Clear the <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>VENT</ecamsys><ecamtitle>AVNCS SYS FAULT</ecamtitle></ecam-data> alert displayed on the <abb>EWD</abb> using
the <tech-label type="pb">CLR</tech-label></para></command></action></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008862.0001001.028"><title>In flight</title><procbody lid="N.00008862.0001001.029"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00008862.0001001.015" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00008862.0001001.030" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>In the case of an air conditioning pack failure:</intro><procbody lid="N.00008862.0001001.031"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008862.0001001.034"><unlist bulltype="NDASH" code="00008862.0001001.017" layer="1" lid="N.00008862.0001001.035"><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008862.0001001.036">The cabin altitude
